T*
(  2. CONCEPT: Exponents count repeated multiplication.) Tj
T*
(  3. INTUITION: Multiplying powers concatenates multiplication chains; powering a power repeats the) Tj
T*
(    chain.) Tj
T*
(  4. DSA CONNECTION: Fast power, rolling hash powers, complexity growth, binary lifting.) Tj
